From 099ceaceeb634ed43a572e49cc9832433a8768ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lapin UX <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 09:30:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add lapin_shell_v1: snap to a fraction of the work area,
 attention events

Lapin UX's taskbar flashes a window's button when it asks for the focus
but doesn't get it, and its snap layouts place windows in halves, thirds
and quarters.
